{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達原本被傳計劃推出一款配備24GB顯存的GeForce RTX 5080，以取代現有的16GB版本，但最新供應鏈消息顯示，這項計劃可能已經被取消。導致這一變化的主要原因，據稱是新型3GB容量GDDR7顯存晶片價格過高，使得24GB版本難以實現合理的成本控制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585950.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:57:33.237110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:49:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:50:53.161061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:50:53.161061+00:00","content_hash":"b245f747f3a205d56baaf992e350e9db4479d67f616826c37e9687eadca113cc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}